  "name": "AnyMove (AI motion capture for any creature)",
  "summary": "Open-source pipeline that animates any rigged creature (wings, tails, eight legs) from one AI video: a video model films front and side views in one frame, a DINOv2 joint reader trained on that creature finds every joint in both views, and the rig is fitted frame by frame and exported as GLB. Ships agent skills to run it.",
  "category": "animations-mocap",
